B.J7=new A.dA("/room-quota-trap","9. Ger\xe7ek rakamlar #3: kalabal\u0131k salonda kota tuza\u011f\u0131",'BEAT  [10:00 - 11:30] Ger\xe7ek rakamlar #3: kalabal\u0131k salonda HTTP 429 tuza\u011f\u0131 ve d\xf6rt \xf6nlem.\nSAY   "Canl\u0131 demolar\u0131 bat\u0131ran klasik hata \u015fudur: tek bir \xfccretsiz API anahtar\u0131n\u0131 b\xfct\xfcn salonla payla\u015fmak. \xdccretsiz katmanda s\u0131n\u0131r anahtara de\u011fil, projeye ba\u011fl\u0131: dakikada 5 ile 15 istek. Y\xfczlerce ki\u015fi tek projeye y\xfcklenince birka\xe7 saniyede HTTP 429, yani kota doldu hatas\u0131 al\u0131rs\u0131n\u0131z. Biz d\xf6rt \xf6nlem ald\u0131k. Kendi uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 kuran herkes kendi AI Studio projesini kullan\u0131yor. Sipari\u015f ba\u015f\u0131na tek \xe7a\u011fr\u0131 gidiyor. Cloud Run\'daki nginx saniyede 10 istek s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 koyuyor. 429 d\xf6nse bile oyun \xe7\xf6km\xfcyor, 250 milisaniyede \u015fehre \xf6zel haz\u0131r yan\u0131tlara ge\xe7iyor. Birazdan demoda bunu sizinle birlikte deneyece\u011fiz."\nHOLD  \xd6nce soldaki k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 "birka\xe7 saniyede HTTP 429" kutusunu, sonra sa\u011fdaki d\xf6rt \xf6nlemi g\xf6ster. nginx 10 r/s + burst 20 kod sabiti (nginx/default.conf.template).\nNEXT  "Savunma tamam. Ayn\u0131 oyunu be\u015f \u015fehre, yeniden derlemeden nas\u0131l uyarl\u0131yoruz?"',!1,!1,1,B.aN,null,B.aJ,B.aC,B.ao,B.aA,B.aw,B.aD,!0,B.aK,B.aB,B.aL)
