B.J8=new A.dA("/multi-city-remote-config","10. Be\u015f DevFest \u015fehri: 3 katmanl\u0131 yap\u0131land\u0131rma",'BEAT  [11:30 - 12:45] Be\u015f DevFest \u015fehri i\xe7in 3 katmanl\u0131 CityEditionController.\nSAY   "Be\u015f DevFest \u015fehri: Berlin, Gaziantep, Konya, Adana ve \u0130stanbul. Her \u015fehir i\xe7in ayr\u0131 uygulama derlemiyoruz. CityEditionController \xfc\xe7 yere s\u0131rayla bak\u0131yor. Birinci \xf6ncelik uygulama i\xe7indeki \u015fehir se\xe7ici: \xfcst bardaki bayrak rozetine dokununca a\xe7\u0131l\u0131yor. \u0130kinci \xf6ncelik URL\'deki remote_city parametresi. Firebase Remote Config \u015fablonu repoda haz\u0131r, bug\xfcn kullanm\u0131yoruz. \xdc\xe7\xfcnc\xfc \xf6ncelik paketin i\xe7indeki city_editions.json dosyas\u0131. Yani tek bir parametreyle b\xfct\xfcn oyun bug\xfcn Alaaddin Kahve ve Tatl\u0131 Dura\u011f\u0131 olarak a\xe7\u0131l\u0131yor."\nHOLD  Sa\u011fdaki kodda activeCityId sat\u0131r\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6ster (city_edition_controller.dart:165): ?? operat\xf6r\xfcyle \xfc\xe7 \xf6ncelik tek sat\u0131rda \xe7\xf6z\xfcl\xfcyor.\nNEXT  "\u015eimdi kaputun alt\u0131ndaki en e\u011flenceli par\xe7aya bakal\u0131m: tatl\u0131 m\u0131 tuzlu mu mekani\u011fi."',!1,!1,1,B.aN,null,B.aJ,B.aC,B.ao,B.aA,B.aw,B.aD,!0,B.aK,B.aB,B.aL)
