B.J5=new A.dA("/generate-vs-decide","Yedek: \xfcretmek mi, karar vermek mi? CafeReview ve Decisions API","BEAT  [BACKUP \xb7 Konya, 45 sn] Slayt 11'den Stage Navigator ile gelinir (Slayt 18). Ayn\u0131 j\xfcri, iki API: \xfcretmek mi, karar vermek mi?\nSAY   \"Bizim j\xfcri iki i\u015f yap\u0131yor. Birincisi esprili yorumu yazmak: bu bir \xfcretim i\u015fi, metin laz\u0131m. \u0130kincisi tatl\u0131 m\u0131 tuzlu mu demek: bu ise kapal\u0131 u\xe7lu bir karar. Bug\xfcn ikisini tek generateContent \xe7a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131nda yap\u0131yoruz. Google'\u0131n yeni Decisions API'si karar\u0131 ayr\u0131 soruyor: metin \xfcretmiyor, her se\xe7enek i\xe7in kalibre edilmi\u015f olas\u0131l\u0131k d\xf6nd\xfcr\xfcyor ve \xe7\u0131kt\u0131 token'\u0131 s\u0131f\u0131r. Hen\xfcz Dart SDK's\u0131 yok, package:http ile d\xfcz REST \xe7a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131 yeterli. Bu oyuna ba\u011flamad\u0131m \xe7\xfcnk\xfc tuz kontrol\xfcn\xfc zaten Dart kodumuz kesin olarak yap\u0131yor; ama kuralla yazamad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rmalarda mutlaka deneyin.\"\nHOLD  \xd6nce soldaki 'tasteVerdict' sat\u0131r\u0131n\u0131, sonra sa\u011fdaki 'type': 'choice' sat\u0131r\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6ster. Gecikme rakam\u0131 s\xf6yleme. [Fact (aistudio.google.com/docs/decisions-api, 13 Nov 2026): gemini-decision-1; noul, choice, score; 1 to 1,000 questions per request; output tokens always 0, only input tokens billed; SDKs: Python, JS 3.2+, REST; v1beta only].\nNEXT  \"Kald\u0131\u011f\u0131m\u0131z yere d\xf6nelim.\" (Stage Navigator ile 12. slayt.)",!1,!1,1,B.aN,null,B.aJ,B.aC,B.ao,B.aA,B.aw,B.aD,!0,B.aK,B.aB,B.aL)
